Leap Into Journalling trains its own compact linear classifier on the public
training split and applies the supplied Ekman label mapping. This is not
Google's BERT model or a Google-endorsed product. Training data is not included
in this distribution. The app adds quantization, threshold selection,
segmentation, abstention, and negation handling; see docs/emotion-model.md.
